A sequel to insane demon Lin Anya. Features mostly all-around learny gameplay, though the ship is more prominent than the other gamemodes. The level mixes design, art and effect decoration with its vibrant and colorful glow style.', '2026-08-30T08:25:28.558Z', '2026-09-02T14:59:50.280Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
An extreme demon focused on ship, timings and swingcopter gameplay that is highly received, with a satisfying flow. The art decoration has a theming of a submerged and overgrown city that the player falls into after the first third.', '2026-08-30T08:25:26.087Z', '2026-09-02T14:59:50.035Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
An extreme demon which has a very well-regarded theming of a desolate and decaying urban world captured through its purely greyscale coloring, design and art decoration style and the very fitting song-choice. The gameplay has been criticised for feeling tedious.', '2026-08-30T17:33:44.704Z', '2026-09-02T14:59:50.141Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
Sequel to the insane demon Corrosion. The decoration is of a similar style to its predecessor, altered to reflect the heightened intensity of the song. Builds off of Corrosion''s gameplay through an increase in difficult timings, a faster pace and higher complexity through the use of 2.2 mechanics.', '2026-08-30T17:33:44.739Z', '2026-09-02T14:59:50.176Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

