I''ve loved Cascada''s song "Bad Boy" since I was a kid, more than 15 years ago. Nightcore music was also extremely popular during that time in my life, and with a thumbnail featuring Hatate Himekaidou from Touhou 12.5, I''ve always wanted to create something for this song. Geometry Dash became the way I chose to express that idea, and this game became a place where I could put my passion into something I created.
Although the level may look simple and not very impressive by today''s Geometry Dash standards, it is still one of the most ambitious things I''ve ever been able to create using the in-game Creator Mode. I hope everyone will continue to support my level, and honestly, I don''t think I''ll be able to continue working on it because my skills in the Creator are still quite limited. 😔😔
Original music: Cascada - Bad Boy (Nightcore) 2004', 100, NULL, NULL, 'CLASSIC', FALSE, FALSE, 13, 'NONE', 'PENDING', NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, '2026-09-05T20:28:55.678Z', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

